            "name": "Mana Spark",
            "steam_appid": 630720,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Checkout our new game</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>COMPLETELY SKILL-BASED COMBAT</i>: Each enemy has its own set of skills, behaviors and collaborations. Learn their patterns and discover their weakness before they lay their hands on you.<br><br></li><li><i>EXCITING PROGRESSION</i>: Be responsible for rebuilding and maintaining your guild's village. Meet new characters, choose your traps, your weapons and keep track of your discoveries and unlocked content.<br><br></li><li><i>HANDCRAFTED &amp; PROCEDURAL GENERATION</i>: Designed to make each new run a completely new experience. Each room is handcrafted to get the most out of the combat, but you'll never explore the same dungeon twice.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <i>COMPLETELY SKILL-BASED COMBAT</i>: Each enemy has its own set of skills, behaviors and collaborations. Learn their patterns and discover their weakness before they lay their hands on you.<br><br></li><li><i>EXCITING PROGRESSION</i>: Be responsible for rebuilding and maintaining your guild's village. Meet new characters, choose your traps, your weapons and keep track of your discoveries and unlocked content.<br><br></li><li><i>HANDCRAFTED &amp; PROCEDURAL GENERATION</i>: Designed to make each new run a completely new experience. Each room is handcrafted to get the most out of the combat, but you'll never explore the same dungeon twice.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A challenging action RPG with deep souls-like combat and rogue-like elements. Explore a dreadful dungeon and fight smart enemies that will plan and collaborate between themselves to defeat you.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Português (Brasil), Russo, Francês, Espanhol (Espanha), Espanhol (América Latina)",
